# ask-this-book

Read `GOAL.md` first (the goal + constitution — the only thing that can block
work), then `AGENTS.md` at the repo root: hard rules, current phase state,
machine facts, and verify commands. `BUILD_PLAN.md` is the living plan
(tactics that expire; renamed from `README.md`); `README.md` is the human-facing
overview; `GLOSSARY.md` translates the repo's vocabulary (sealed suite, gate,
capture, retry, ...) into plain words when a term is unclear.
